    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『すみません。何を言っているかわからないようなので、筆談にしますの』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『転校生くん、今日も保健委員会のお手伝いしてますのね。偉いですの～、と言いたかったんですの♪』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『いま、保険医の先生は席を外してますの？　そうですか、困りましたの……。』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『ちょっと、相談したいことがあったんですけど』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『他の保健委員の子も、いませんのね。了解ですの。』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『では、転校生くんに相談にのってもらうことにしますの♪』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『あの。見ておわかりかと思いますけど、かいり虫歯になっちゃったんですの』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『毎日毎日、甘ぁい飴ちゃんばかりペロペロしてたせいだと思いますの。』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『朝、起きたら口がちゃんと開かないぐらい痛くて』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『合唱部の大会も近いのに、これでは歌うこともできませんの』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『だから困ってるんですの。でも歯医者さんは怖いし、』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『保健室で痛み止めとかもらえたらいいなって……♪』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『えっ？　かいりの字、綺麗ですか？』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『ありがとうございます、お習字は得意ですの。』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『むかしから、歌声と字だけは自信がありますのよ～♪』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「……ふひゃん!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「ひゃひゃ、ひゃひひまひゅの!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『いきなり触ったらビックリしますの、転校生くん。』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『痛いんですから、ほっぺプニプニしたら駄目ですのよ～？』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『えっ、虫歯にしては腫れてない？』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『言われてみればそうですの、虫歯じゃないんですかねこれ……？』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『気になるので、ちょっと口のなかを見てくださいません？』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「あ～ん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「……へんほうへいふん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『見てくださいよ、遠慮せずに。かいり恥ずかしくありませんの。』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『毎日、ちゃんと歯磨きをしてますの。だからこそ、虫歯になったのが不思議なんですけど』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『ちゃんと見てくださいね、かいりの口のなか。』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『歯が、どうなってるか確認してほしいんですの。自分では、奥歯のあたりは見えにくいですし』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『転校生くんだけが、頼りですの』……あ～ん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「………♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/embarrassed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「ひょ、ひょめんなひゃい。やっはり、はふはひいへふの♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/embarrassed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『照れちゃいますの。口のなかなんて、あまりひとに見せるものでもありませんしね。』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『転校生くん、男の子だし……。いけないことしてる気分になりますの♪』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「あ～ん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
