    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「ほのへんれひゅの、わかりまひゅ？　ひたいんでひゅの、すっほひゅ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『う～ん。見た感じ、どこも虫歯になってませんの？』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『どういうことでしょう、こんなに痛いのに……。』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『歯ではなく、もっと内側に痛みの根っこがあるのかしら？』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『顎とか、頬骨とか、ほっぺのお肉とかに』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『まぁいいですの。虫歯ではなさそう、ということだけ確認できてよかったですの♪』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『歯医者さんは苦手ですけど、歯をドリルでガリガリ削られたりするのが怖いだけですから。』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『虫歯でないなら、そんな心配いりませんものね』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『今日これからでも、歯医者さんに行ってみますの。』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『たぶん、痛みの原因を教えてくれるでしょう。きっと、顎関節症とかですのよ』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『かいり合唱部だから、口をおおきく開いて歌ったりしますの。』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『だから、顎が疲れたり、炎症を起こしたりするんですの』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『他の部員に、それで顎関節症になった子がいますし』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『かいりも、きっとそうですの。あぁ、安心しました。ありがとう、転校生くん♪』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/embarrassed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「『おかしなことさせちゃって、ごめんなさいね。恥ずかしいから、みんなには内緒ですの。』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-mouth",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mouth_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
